      "content": "hey, so i went for a long walk yesterday and my left calf feels kinda weird today. it's a bit swollen and feels a little warm when i touch it, maybe even a bit red? i think i might have just strained something or pulled a muscle. do u think i should just rest it and maybe use some ice?",
